BEGIN:VEVENT
DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://tfl.gov.uk/tube-dlr-overground/status/?Input=&lineIds=&dateTypeSelect=Future%20date&direction=&startDate=2027-01-06T22:45:00&endDate=2027-01-07T01:29:00">Disruption map.</a>\n\nWEAVER LINE: Tuesday 5\, Wednesday 6 and Thursday 7 January\, after 2245 each evening\, no service between Hackney Downs and Cheshunt / Enfield Town. Use London Underground connections between Central London and Seven Sisters\, and for Rectory Road and Stoke Newington\, use Clapton station. Last trains operate at 2245 from Liverpool Street to Cheshunt\, 2300 from Enfield Town to Liverpool Street\, 2253 from Liverpool Street to Enfield Town and 2302 from Cheshunt to Liverpool Street. Replacement buses operate.
DTEND:20270107T012900Z
DTSTART:20270106T224500Z
SUMMARY:Weaver line: Part Closure
UID:fe86b38a-4e98-4f23-a01f-77ab47012d45@fe86.org
END:VEVENT
